## Open decisions

- Receiver protocol: ELRS vs SBUS, depends on which transmitter
- Battery capacity: larger pack means longer flight but eats payload margin
- Whether to 3D print the 30x30 adapter or buy one

## Known constraints

- F450 at 450 mm wheelbase caps prop size around 10-11 inches. 1045 is at the limit
- Total payload capacity on this airframe is roughly 1 to 1.5 kg. A 5 lb payload needs a 650 mm+ hex, which is a separate build
- 60A ESC is heavy overkill for RS2212s at 12-15A each. Fine, and it carries over to a larger future build